** =====================================================================
**  差分加熱キャビティ（3D、Boussinesq 自然対流、層流・定常）
**  実行: ykep -j=examples/inp/cavity-nc-1.inp int
**  *GRID は ykep 拡張（等間隔直交格子を生成し、面 XM/XP/YM/YP/ZM/ZP と
**  要素集合 ALL を自動定義）。*NODE/*ELEMENT で書いても同じ。
** =====================================================================
*HEADING
 Differentially heated cavity, Ra ~ 1e3 (de Vahl Davis)
*PARAMETER
 L      = 0.1
 n      = 12
 nz     = 3
 T_hot  = 310.0
 T_cold = 290.0
 T_ref  = 0.5 * (T_hot + T_cold)
 rho    = 1.0
 mu     = 0.01
 Cp     = 1000.0
 k      = 1.0
 g      = 9.81
 Ra     = 1000.0
 nu     = mu / rho
 alpha  = k / (rho * Cp)
 beta   = Ra * nu * alpha / (g * (T_hot - T_cold) * L**3)
*GRID, NX=<n>, NY=<n>, NZ=<nz>, LX=<L>, LY=<L>, LZ=<L * nz / n>
*MATERIAL, NAME=AIR
*DENSITY
 <rho>
*VISCOSITY
 <mu>
*SPECIFIC HEAT
 <Cp>
*CONDUCTIVITY
 <k>
*EXPANSION, ZERO=<T_ref>
 <beta>
*FLUID SECTION, ELSET=ALL, MATERIAL=AIR
*INITIAL CONDITIONS, TYPE=TEMPERATURE
 ALL, <T_ref>
** 側面は no-slip（既定）、奥行き方向 z の 2 面は対称面（準 2D）。
** 温度は左右のみ固定、他は断熱（既定）
*BOUNDARY, TYPE=SYMMETRY
 ZM
 ZP
*BOUNDARY, TYPE=TEMPERATURE
 XM, <T_hot>
 XP, <T_cold>
*STEP, NAME=Steady
*NAVIER STOKES, TURBULENCE=LAMINAR, STEADY STATE, HEAT TRANSFER=COUPLED
*DLOAD
 ALL, GRAV, <g>, 0.0, -1.0, 0.0
*CONTROLS, PARAMETERS=DISCRETIZATION
 CONVECTION=UPWIND, PRESSURE_VELOCITY=SIMPLE
*CONTROLS, PARAMETERS=RELAXATION
 VELOCITY=0.2, PRESSURE=0.05, TEMPERATURE=0.5, ADAPTIVE=NO
*CONTROLS, PARAMETERS=SOLVER
 PRESSURE=BICGSTAB, MAX_OUTER=3000, TOL=1e-4
** HTML は messi mirador（three.js）の 3D ビューア（messi 未導入なら警告してスキップ）
*OUTPUT, FIELD, FORMAT=VTK+HTML
*ELEMENT OUTPUT
 U, P, T
*END STEP
